+# FieldBook Sync v8.1.14
+
+Local-first Windows survey field-book OCR, review, mapping, QA/QC, and export application.
+
+## v8.1.14 highlights
+
+- Red update notification dot on **Help** when a newer GitHub release is available.
+- **Available Point Ranges CSV** utility for raw survey TXT/CSV/TSV uploads. It uses every numeric PointID (independent of code-profile filtering), reports gaps between occupied numbers, and always includes the final open-ended range to infinity.
+- Automatic updates now use a launcher handoff so Setup starts only after FieldBook Sync has fully exited.
+- Setup has an additional running-process wait to avoid replacing a locked `FieldBookSync.exe`.
+
+Stable update manifest:
+`https://raw.githubusercontent.com/cpaul1988/FieldBookSync/main/update.json`
+
+Publisher: **Clever Bird Development**
+Default per-user install path: `%LOCALAPPDATA%\Programs\FieldBookSync`
+Mutable projects, settings, caches, and job history remain under `%LOCALAPPDATA%\FieldBookSync` and are preserved during upgrades.
